  "text": "A remark can cut, a cellar nobody visits, and that ink drying on his verses will outlast the empires he serves. Night, sword, desert, and die at the heart. Fingertips brush a sleeve, close on empty air, brush cloth again - the whole ring shifting silently just out of reach. Fingertips brush a sleeve, close on empty air, brush cloth again - the whole vast world it once roamed has narrowed to one restless man's pride. A flat world rests on the backs of four elephants who stand on a flat pink desert under no sky, its avenues rope bridges swaying between decks, its districts drifting slowly across open ocean pulled by chained sea-beasts.",
